   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.7,
    "text": "The most dangerous food for your liver is not alcohol,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 2.7,
    "end": 4.82,
    "text": "it's not cholesterol-heavy foods, and it's not sugar."
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 4.82,
    "end": 6.34,
    "text": "If you're trying to prevent a fatty liver,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 6.34,
    "end": 9.46,
    "text": "this food can penetrate deep into the fat cells,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 9.46,
    "end": 10.3,
    "text": "including your liver,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 10.3,
    "end": 12.42,
    "text": "and can get lodged in there for a year and a half."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 12.42,
    "end": 14.86,
    "text": "It's also in salad dressing and mayo."
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 14.86,
    "end": 17.02,
    "text": "They use it in virtually every single restaurant"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 17.02,
    "end": 19.86,
    "text": "to fry everything, your protein bars."
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 19.86,
    "end": 22.98,
    "text": "And all of the chips and crackers that are zero sugar,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 22.98,
    "end": 26.34,
    "text": "it goes to incredible chemical processing and heat."
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 26.34,
    "end": 28.34,
    "text": "It's very high in omega-6 fatty acids."
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 28.34,
    "end": 29.46,
    "text": "It causes inflammation."
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 29.46,
    "end": 32.1,
    "text": "The most dangerous food for the liver is seed oil,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 32.1,
    "end": 34.62,
    "text": "which is an industrial oil exposed to hexane,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 34.62,
    "end": 36.5,
    "text": "which is a solvent that's a gasoline."
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 36.5,
    "end": 39.82,
    "text": "Main seed oils I'm talking about are corn, soy, canola,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 39.82,
    "end": 41.82,
    "text": "cotton seed, but it's also in sunflower,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 41.82,
    "end": 43.42,
    "text": "safflower, and grape seed oil."
   },
   {
    "id": "t20",
    "start": 43.42,
    "end": 45.38,
    "text": "One of the best things to help with a fatty liver"
   },
   {
    "id": "t21",
    "start": 45.38,
    "end": 47.1,
    "text": "is to take something called cut cut."
   },
   {
    "id": "t22",
    "start": 47.1,
    "end": 48.86,
    "text": "That's a special bile salt that can help reduce"
   },
   {
    "id": "t23",
    "start": 48.86,
    "end": 50.06,
    "text": "the inflammation in your liver."
   },
   {
    "id": "t24",
    "start": 50.06,
    "end": 51.94,
    "text": "But instead of seed oils, cook with butter,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t25",
    "start": 51.94,
    "end": 54.82,
    "text": "coconut oil, olive oil, tallow, and lard."
   },
   {
    "id": "t26",
    "start": 54.82,
    "end": 56.82,
    "text": "You"
   }
